segment.source:
::The doctor answers, one half of his face remaining motionless.::

I'm sorry to tell you this, sir, but Wesley is dead. The refuge, it was attacked... ::wheeze::

::He proceeds to recount the attack, and for some reason, you just can't shake off the odd feeling of familiarity with the events described.::&lt;end&gt;

Dead. ::He bows his head down.::

They were killed... ::wheeze:: during the attack.

::After shaking his head, he proceeds to recount the attack. For some reason, you just can't shake off the odd feeling of familiarity with the events described.::&lt;end&gt;

